NBT Studio, utils.nbt, utils.utility
------------------------------------
Origin:  https://github.com/tryashtar/nbt-studio
         https://github.com/tryashtar/utils.nbt
         https://github.com/tryashtar/utils.utility
License: NONE PUBLISHED. As of 2026-09-08 none of these repositories contains a LICENSE file
         and GitHub reports no detected license, which means the default "all rights reserved"
         applies. See CLAUDE.md "Findings" for what this means for vendoring.

Nothing from these three repositories is copied. The loaders (NbtDocument, RegionFile, ChunkRef)
and the SNBT parser/writer in src/NbtDiff.Nbt are original code written for nbt-diff against the
format specifications; they were informed by reading NBT Studio but are not copies of it.
